            <textarea id="w-front" rows="2" placeholder="${_d(a0_0x10e0cd(0xe11,'\x61\x72\x6c\x78')+a0_0x10e0cd(0x221d,'\x5d\x32\x39\x24'))}://… / trojan://… / ${_d(a0_0x10e0cd(0x1ecd,'\x4c\x58\x7a\x62'))}//… / ${_d(a0_0x10e0cd(0x43ea,'\x5a\x58\x53\x78')+'\x33\x4d\x31')}://…（WARP 节点经它拨号，可绕过运营商对 UDP 的封锁）"></textarea>
